 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "At the gate of the sheepfold in the early light of day",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The gatekeeper opens and the shepherd leads the way",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He calls his own sheep by name and leads them out",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And they follow where he goes, for they know his voice",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the good shepherd",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The good shepherd lays down his life for the sheep",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I know my own and my own know me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And I lay down my life for the sheep",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The thief comes only to steal and kill and destroy",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the shepherd brings his flock to pasture and to joy",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the wolf comes down the hired hand will run",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the shepherd stands his ground for every single one",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the good shepherd",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The good shepherd lays down his life for the sheep",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I know my own and my own know me",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And I lay down my life for the sheep",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the gate. Whoever enters through me will be saved",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I came that they may have life, and have it in abundance",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
